          </p>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/one-hundred-camels/critics"
          class="block border border-ink/20 bg-paper p-5 hover:bg-bone/30 hover:border-ink transition-colors"
        >
          <p class="font-display text-lg tracking-tight mb-1">Hear the critics →</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 leading-snug">
            The best arguments against Pleistocene rewilding, in the critics' own voices. Then considered responses.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/near-time"
          class="block border border-ink/20 bg-paper p-5 hover:bg-bone/30 hover:border-ink transition-colors"
        >
          <p class="font-display text-lg tracking-tight mb-1">Open the atlas →</p>
